SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     vveelllluumm , vveellcchheecckk , vveellpplloott , vveellppiicc , mmaakkee

NNOOTTEESS
     A -mmaarrkk markup holds the new revision PLUS the removals, so
     a markup of two crowded sheets can carry more than the 400
     objects a drawing holds when it is opened again; it always
     prints.

     This is the one tool that holds two drawings at once, which
     is why it is a tool of its own: nothing else pays for the
     second object table.
